    - target: {fileID: 9001207236097238742, guid: 6067253ee42b3804485503092ce0eaa6,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "The door in the study room feels really weird\u2026 Daddy said the
        books have to be just right for it to open. I tried arranging them myself,
        but I accidentally tore a page.\n\nHe didn\u2019t tell me exactly how to
        place them. Maybe it has to do with the colors from that poem? Like lining
        up blue books and green ones to make the door open!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
